"vonoprazan": "Vonoprazan suggests erosive esophagitis, GERD or H. pylori treatment. When packaged with clarithromycin, QT prolongation and many drug interactions become relevant.",
"cimetidine": "Cimetidine suggests heartburn or ulcer treatment, often over the counter. It raises levels of warfarin, phenytoin and theophylline and is linked to confusion in older adults.",
"dronabinol": "Dronabinol is prescription THC, suggesting AIDS wasting or chemotherapy nausea. Sedation, anxiety, tachycardia, fainting and confusion are linked to it, especially with alcohol or sedatives.",
